		{
			dependencies: ["6E27B9938B280291"]
			description: [
				"Items don't stack with other items of the same type that have a different name. This fact, combined with the ability to automate the renaming of items, can help greatly with complex automations."
				""
				"One way to do this is with the &6Name Casting Mold&r from &bGT&r in a &3Forming Press&r. Rename the mold in an anvil block to set the desired name."
				""
				"Another way is to use the &6Inscriber Name Press&r from &bAE2&r in an &3Inscriber&r. To set the name, Right-Click with one of the &6Cutting Knives&r on open air to open its menu. Type in the desired name, and insert any ingot that has the &a#ae2:metal_ingots&r tag (like iron). Then, take the press out of the menu."
				""
				"In both methods, put the item to be renamed in the machine, and it will get renamed. Neither the mold nor press are consumed."
			]
			id: "6F1530D71AA11FFE"
			shape: "hexagon"
			tasks: [
